{{!
    @template block_compass/ghost

    The ghost card: a count, not a load (PLAN.md §2, tier 2). Used for the tier 2
    "+N other courses" card and for the per-strip "+N more" cards.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * count - the number.
    * text - what is counted, already translated.
    * cta - call to action, already translated, optional.
    * url - where the card leads.
    * kind - tier2, new or favourites.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "count": 87,
        "text": "other courses",
        "cta": "Explore all",
        "url": "https://example.com/my/courses.php",
        "kind": "tier2"
    }
}}
<a href="{{url}}" class="compass-ghost card h-100 text-center text-decoration-none" data-region="ghost-card" data-ghost="{{kind}}">
    <div class="card-body d-flex flex-column justify-content-center">
        <span class="compass-ghost-count">+{{count}}</span>
        <span class="compass-ghost-text small text-muted">{{text}}</span>
        {{#cta}}
        <span class="compass-ghost-cta small mt-2">{{cta}}</span>
        {{/cta}}
    </div>
</a>
